<title>USA: Litton files shelf for preferred, debt.</title>
<headline>Litton files shelf for preferred, debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Litton Industries Inc filed a shelf registration on Monday with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $400 million in preferred stock and debt securities.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, Litton said in the filing.</p>
<p>Litton is a high technology aerospace and defense company that makes advanced electronic and defense systems, information systems and marine engineering and products.</p>
</text>
